3. Detailed Functional Test Cases

Test Case ID: FTC_01
Title: Valid Member record routing
Business Scenario: A complete and correct member record is processed.
Input Condition: Member record with all required fields populated and valid data (e.g., MemberId present, valid BirthDate, Gender in allowed values, etc.).
Expected Behavior: Record is routed to ValidMemberRecords and loaded to MemberSink.

Test Case ID: FTC_02
Title: Invalid Member record routing
Business Scenario: An incomplete or invalid member record is processed.
Input Condition: Member record with missing or invalid required fields (e.g., missing MemberId, invalid BirthDate, etc.).
Expected Behavior: Record is routed to ErrorMemberRecords and not loaded to MemberSink.

